 <h3><u>Zehra ki hai rukhsati</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>bane hain dulha ali..(2)<br> zehra ki hai rukhsati..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Ghar me aayaate haq ka ujaala huwa<br> noor arz o samaa ka dobaala huwa<br> dekho qur'aan khud shaahwaala hua<br> mil gayi deen ko ek nayi zindagi</p> 
  <p>2. Jibraeele ameen ki munaadi hai ye<br> dekho ek shaahzaadi ki shaadi hai ye<br> aur shaadi magar kitni saadi hai ye<br> na hai israaf aur na dikhaawa koyi</p> 
  <p>3. Kaisa saada jahez is dulhan ko mila<br> ek takya o charkha aur ek aasia<br> ek khajooro ke patton ka bistar bhi tha<br> kooza o mashk aur ek suraahi mili</p> 
  <p>4. Aqde zahra o haidar ki ye sunnatein<br> momino tumpe bhi farz hai itaa'atein<br> jaise andaaz zahra ki shaadi ke hain<br> us taraah byaah do apni beti ko bhi</p> 
  <p>5. Aqd ke aasmaan par fasaane bhi hain<br> huro gilmaan ke lab par taraane bhi hain<br> sher kuch apne hamko sunaane bhi hain<br> momino tum bhi dohraawo misraa yehi</p> 
  <p>6. Baithi binte payambar amaari me hain<br> saath huraane jannat sawaari me hain<br> phul jannat ke phulon ki kyaari me hai<br> khushbu hai aaj phayli gali dar gali</p> 
  <p>Ya ali ya ali..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Ilm aur noor ke do samandar mile<br> qurbatein badh gayi faasle mit gaye<br> leke binte nabi ko nabi khud chale<br> Ya ali bol uthe har chaman har kali</p> 
  <p>8. Ju'n hi bayt e wilaayat me pohnchi dulhan<br> aayaton se sajaa dekha sehne chaman<br> sura kausar ka karne laga ye sukhan<br> mit nahi sakti taa hashr nasle nabi</p> 
  <p>9. Dekhiye to ay maajid samaa dekhiye<br> khud payambar bhi hai shadmaan dekhiye<br> aaj bayt e ali me jinaa dekhiye<br> jalne waale jalein ham kahenge yehi</p> 
